OBSTACLES

FEATURES:
- (ground) deformation
- spline

SURFACES

TERRAIN

OBSTACLES



Can create ground deformation (not straight)






Can create winding courses:

e.g. 

...createCourseShape({
  type: "path",

  points: [
    [0, 10],
    [3, 7],
    [4, 3],
    [-2, 0],
    [-4, -4],
    [0, -7],
    [2, -10],
  ],

  curved: true,
  width: 4.5,

  tolerance: 0.025,
  maxSegmentLength: 0.4,
  miterLimit: 2,

  wall: {
    color: "#777777",
    height: 0.65,
    thickness: 0.25,

    maxEdge: 0.25,
    colliderTolerance: 0.025,
    colliderMaxEdge: 0.6,
  },
}),


//////

Add self-intersection handling, rounded end caps and variable path widths, while retaining the optimized direct-polygon approach for ordinary winding courses.

/////////

Variable-width winding course

Variable path widths	Narrow corridors and wide landing areas
Rounded end caps	Smoother starts and finishes on ordinary paths
Sharp turns	Miter-limited corners
Overlapping paths	Optional Boolean-union fallback
Existing floor/walls	Continue sharing the resulting polygon

...createCourseShape({
  type: "path",

  points: [
    [0, 10],
    [2, 7],
    [4, 3],
    [-1, 0],
    [-4, -4],
    [0, -7],
    [2, -10],
  ],

  curved: true,

  // Width changes along the path
  widths: [
    5,
    4,
    3,
    6,
    3.5,
    4,
    5,
  ],

  tolerance: 0.025,
  maxSegmentLength: 0.4,

  capSegments: 16,
  miterLimit: 2,

  // Use segment union for overlapping paths
  allowOverlap: true,

  wall: {
    color: "#777777",
    height: 0.65,
    thickness: 0.25,
    maxEdge: 0.25,
    colliderTolerance: 0.025,
    colliderMaxEdge: 0.6,
  },
}),


// /////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

Next recommended stage: Add automatic self-intersection detection, width interpolation based on actual spline distance rather than sample index, 
and rounded caps in the robust union fallback. 
This will make complex winding courses more predictable without requiring allowOverlap to be set manually.


...createCourseShape({
  type: "path",

  points: [
    [0, 10],
    [3, 7],
    [4, 3],
    [-2, 0],
    [-4, -4],
    [0, -7],
    [2, -10],
  ],

  curved: true,

  widths: [5, 4, 3, 6, 3.5, 4, 5],

  tolerance: 0.025,
  maxSegmentLength: 0.4,

  capSegments: 16,
  miterLimit: 2,

  wall: {
    color: "#777777",
    height: 0.65,
    thickness: 0.25,
    maxEdge: 0.25,
    colliderTolerance: 0.025,
    colliderMaxEdge: 0.6,
  },
}),

